# Split by responsibility

Do not grow god files. Extract a sibling component, hook, or CSS section when a file crosses these soft caps:

- UI components: **~350 lines**
- Hooks / utils: **~500 lines**
- Feature CSS: **~500 lines** — put the surface in a folder with an `index.css` barrel (see `src/design/public-surface/`)

Follow existing feature layout: `pages/`, `components/`, `hooks/`, `utils/`. Match `src/features/website/components/home-sections/` when a surface has several sections.

Keep public exports stable. If a file moves, re-export from the old path.

```jsx
// BAD — another 400 lines of wizard JSX in the same sheet
{step === 'details' ? <div className="bb-editor-step">...</div> : null}

// GOOD — sibling step file, sheet stays the stepper
{step === 'details' ? <ProductEditorDetailsStep draft={draft} patch={patch} /> : null}
```

Do not rewrite CSS architecture (no CSS-modules migration) just to shrink files. Do not split domain math or seed data unless it is mixed with UI.
